        <p>Paid advertising is the fastest way to generate roofing leads — and the fastest way to burn money if you do it wrong. Roofing consistently ranks as the most expensive home services vertical. Google Ads costs jumped 19% year-over-year. But done correctly, paid ads deliver immediate, measurable leads.</p>

